                <mxCell id="c257" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#107C41&quot;&gt;DATA RULES&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9.5px&quot;&gt;• single writer: Logic App service login (SELECT/UPDATE parents · INSERT audit)&lt;br&gt;• child rows replaced atomically on every upsert — no orphan state&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CorrelationId&lt;/b&gt; is the grouping key across the 3 unrelated natural keys — indexed on all parents + audit&lt;br&gt;• parents store the full GitHub publish metadata → the whole orchestrator payload is rebuildable from SQL alone&lt;br&gt;• EncryptedPassword: written via API, never returned by any read path&lt;br&gt;• EnrichmentStatus + DeploymentStatus drive the portal and the launch gate&lt;br&gt;• EnrichmentAuditLog is the end-to-end trace surfaced in the portal timeline ❺&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#107C41;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2A37;whiteSpace=wrap;shadow=1;" parent="zkkXeUUUsrh3nLwFM-lW-2" vertex="1">
